00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:40.700
IMPORTANT FOR OUR PHYSICIAN TO

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:41.734
ENSURE THAT THERE IS NO

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:44.237
DISCRIMINATION IN ANY SYSTEM OF

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:46.005
CARE, PARTICULARLY IN THAT THAT

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:48.007
OF THE EMERGENCY DEPARTMENTS AND

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.575
HOSPITALS WHERE THEY TOO OFTEN

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:51.744
LAND. UNFORTUNATELY WE, WE THINK

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:54.480
THAT THIS BILL DOES CLARIFY THAT

00:06:54.547 --> 00:06:55.481
COVERAGE FOR A PSYCHIATRIC

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:58.017
EMERGENCY MEDICAL CONDITION,

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.051
PARTICULARLY BY HEALTH PLANS AND

00:06:59.118 --> 00:07:02.488
INSURERS, APPLIES REGARDLESS OF

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:04.090
WHETHER THE PATIENT IS VOLUNTARY

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:04.991
OR INVOLUNTARY. THAT'S REALLY

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:06.726
THAT, YOU KNOW, THE LEGAL STATUS

00:07:06.793 --> 00:07:08.694
REALLY SHOULD HAVE NOTHING TO DO

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:09.862
WITH WHETHER OR NOT THEY'RE

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:10.997
TREATED, WHETHER OR NOT AND HOW

00:07:11.063 --> 00:07:12.098
THEY'RE TREATED, AND WHETHER OR

00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:14.300
NOT THAT THAT TREATMENT IS PAID

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:17.303
FOR. AB 1316 IS PROPOSED TO BE

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.173
AMENDED. AND SO IT WILL ALLOW

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:21.240
MEDI-CAL CLARIFY THAT MEDI-CAL

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:24.310
WILL PAY FOR ALL THOSE SERVICES

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:25.478
UP TO THE POINT WHERE THEY'RE

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:26.512
ACTUALLY ADMITTED TO AN

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:28.514
INPATIENT UNIT, THIS IS A LONG

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:30.283
TIME IN COMING, AND WE'RE VERY

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:31.984
GRATEFUL TO SEE THAT, OUR

00:07:32.051 --> 00:07:33.419
PSYCHIATRISTS BELIEVE THAT

00:07:33.486 --> 00:07:34.387
PATIENTS WITH PSYCHIATRIC

00:07:34.453 --> 00:07:37.190
MEDICAL EMERGENCY CONDITIONS

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:38.191
DESERVE TIMELY CARE AND TIMELY

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:41.194
TREATMENT. AND ON THE SAME TERMS

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.295
AND CONDITIONS AS PATIENTS WITH

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:43.763
OTHER NON PSYCHIATRIC MEDICAL

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.133
CONDITIONS. SO THAT WOULD

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.703
INCLUDE TIMELY TRANSPORTATION.

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:51.871
BUT I THINK WE'RE IN A BAD

00:07:51.938 --> 00:07:53.005
POSITION IF WE'RE ALLOWING

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:54.340
HEALTH CARE PLANS AND INSURERS

00:07:54.407 --> 00:07:56.976
TO PICK AND CHOOSE PATIENT

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:57.577
COVERAGE LEVELS, REIMBURSEMENT

00:07:57.643 --> 00:08:00.613
LEVELS OR TRANSFER OPTIONS BASED

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:01.781
ON WHETHER OR NOT THERE'S A

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:03.850
LEGAL STATUS FOR THAT PARTICULAR

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:04.917
PATIENT, IT JUST SHOULD BE

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:07.486
STRAIGHT ACROSS THE BOARD, THE

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:08.721
SAME. SO IT LEVELS THE PLAYING

00:08:08.788 --> 00:08:10.723
FIELD. THIS THIS BILL DOES WITH

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:14.427
RESPECT TO THOSE LEGAL STATUSES

00:08:14.493 --> 00:08:17.463
AND HELPS CLARIFY THAT BOTH

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:21.200
QUALITY, AND STANDARD OF CARE IS

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.401
THE SAME FOR BOTH, AND THAT

00:08:22.468 --> 00:08:24.136
HOSPITALS GET REIMBURSED FOR IT

00:08:24.203 --> 00:08:26.305
EITHER WAY, WHICH IS IMPORTANT.

00:08:26.372 --> 00:08:27.707
THANK YOU. THANK YOU BOTH FOR

00:08:27.773 --> 00:08:28.941
YOUR TESTIMONY TODAY. ANY OTHER

